atherine Johnson, immortalized by Taraji P. Henson=E2=80=99s portrayal in t=
he film =E2=80=9CHidden Figures=E2=80=9D as one of the key participants who=
 helped enable America=E2=80=99s 20th century space program.=20
    </p>

