    <p class=3D"paragraph-elevate inline-placeholder vossi-paragraph_elevat=
e" data-uri=3D"cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/paragraph-a26e9b=
f81f4fc70ffe9e2241d8a75b79@published" data-editable=3D"text" data-component=
-name=3D"paragraph" data-article-gutter=3D"true">
            As we mourn her loss, we should celebrate her tenacity. The wei=
ght of what Johnson had overcome was immense. People doubted her because sh=
e was a woman, and because of the color of her skin. And yet, she persisted=
. In fact, she is known to have said that she didn=E2=80=99t have time to t=
hink of herself as anything but equal.=20
    </p>

    <p class=3D"paragraph-elevate inline-placeholder vossi-paragraph_elevat=
e" data-uri=3D"cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/paragraph-9ea2bf=
629ad0171e6a50bacb0614aa3f@published" data-editable=3D"text" data-component=
-name=3D"paragraph" data-article-gutter=3D"true">
            We should celebrate her brilliance. Astronaut John Glenn famous=
ly asked Katherine to personally recheck the calculations made by electroni=
c computers before his Friendship 7 mission to space. =E2=80=9CIf she says =
they=E2=80=99re good,=E2=80=9D he said, =E2=80=9Cthen I=E2=80=99m ready to =
go.=E2=80=9D =20
    </p>

