</ul></ul></div>

    <p class=3D"paragraph-elevate inline-placeholder vossi-paragraph_elevat=
e" data-uri=3D"cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/paragraph-4ae53e=
139c2715cd580a7bc9aa19bf1e@published" data-editable=3D"text" data-component=
-name=3D"paragraph" data-article-gutter=3D"true">
            In your honor, Katherine, I=E2=80=99m going to keep counting =
=E2=80=93 counting the number of girls we bring into computer science, coun=
ting the number of black female scientists in our textbooks, counting the d=
ays until we reach gender parity. =20
    </p>

    <p class=3D"paragraph-elevate inline-placeholder vossi-paragraph_elevat=
e" data-uri=3D"cms.cnn.com/_components/paragraph/instances/paragraph-111201=
529394d0f841c61282e948e7ba@published" data-editable=3D"text" data-component=
-name=3D"paragraph" data-article-gutter=3D"true">
            We=E2=80=99ll look up at the moon tonight, and we=E2=80=99ll be=
 thinking of you, your bravery, your legacy. And we=E2=80=99ll be forever g=
rateful. Rest in power, Katherine.=20
    </p>

